4PAXkp-oHZcQ7kNvwGu9oEx&_nc_oc=Adry6OZO8uGWMh-RYVajgk7C-iI9egeUTWKslwom1_bdMbEvH-9md1QM2k4rr7WMhTg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMM-g8d2JhQHeWC_XI5DSTtwyL8PZpRsKQEpjDXqKEH1A&oe=6AE4A637"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DPzkWxFwO3kQ7kNvwHipfR9&_nc_oc=AdqBgueDPhNwkqu_n3T46L6xROOSoOWHC39YmehypDHHv7-sY0QGuLq2nDkCJnDywpg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNW8j6LCA3q1Kr71Kjak0xewlELMojvCASVjQ3GZrZsfQ&oe=6AE4A7CA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Gy2eB4u5WVkQ7kNvwFjmkqs&_nc_oc=Adpo1-zWnpcgHfkcVqb2RtFyWPGXEmBDGch23r-bq0j4lBlW9uKS1ZXtGSZ0PouL9dw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNcWcbsHqpSsaUl2qi7Au38lLVEuz7em-e84ooQ_tP57g&oe=6AE494EF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8x15NRDGEx0Q7kNvwHYgzS2&_nc_oc=Adqlqa5OWo8DjeF4WYZSA5SFi_Hhq0MzPl-SU_Ku-6G_Zwvqx5CBK-S5gap_FiK3B98&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPNvsriFjDHEPQXYjMi41GlNGjfyUVkN3jox9QADrDHiw&oe=6AE4B683"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vcOWNMZpoYEQ7kNvwHgE3gR&_nc_oc=Ado6_5Pi0VdIlAZaMckYxzqATZ8NGmamyrnb7FiX0YuIFA79bMpRbPUhhpsilQN1uzw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQML4VtwwavN1ug70i0BvPOjKzMsODZFEZOGn97ugDOFKA&oe=6AE4AED8"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tA1Aw3qA_ZEQ7kNvwGEzb91&_nc_oc=AdpSxjWRmYWOZG5O2_JcWYZpNrRMnaQiyf5-zbWPkhxf20PM69CUSY9aKFTyr5F9eiw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMcgII7EKLU5HTO8V6cJxBw3YVUc2tLsKKDJEShglqCbg&oe=6AE4C1FC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080